	<title>Rezolve AI (RZLV): Faking ARR by Acquiring Failing AI Start-ups w/ Declining Revenue; Promotional CEO’s History of False Statements - Fuzzy Panda Research</title>
	<link rel="canonical" href="https://fuzzypandaresearch.com/rezolve-ai-rzlv-faking-arr-declining-revenue-dan-wagner-chatgpt-wrapper/" />
