	<meta property="og:type" content="article" />
	<meta property="og:title" content="Rezolve AI (RZLV): Faking ARR by Acquiring Failing AI Start-ups w/ Declining Revenue; Promotional CEO’s History of False Statements - Fuzzy Panda Research" />
	<meta property="og:description" content="Rezolve AI is a mobile phone tech company that tried to SPAC and failed in 2021. Management added the letters &quot;AI&quot; to its name in 2023, despite having no AI product, and, low and behold, completed a SPAC in 2024. A bunch of hyped press releases later, and Rezolve reached an ~$2bn valuation even though it had $0 in AI revenue last year." />
