<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Conclusion – Formers &amp; Even ‘Brainpowa’ Told Us to Short RZLV</h2>



<p>When former executives and the company’s own LLM recommend shorting RZLV stock &#8230; you probably should.</p>



<p>We asked former Rezolve executives, &#8220;Would you invest in Rezolve?&#8221; They told us:</p>



